    <!-- About Page -->
    <string name="about_title">About PocketDev</string>
    <string name="about_version_text">Version 2.1.0</string>
    <string name="about_subtitle">A fast, full-featured mobile code editor and Linux development environment for Android.</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">• Code Intelligence: Built-in Language Server Protocol (LSP) support with hover documentation, go-to-definition, find references, symbol rename, and real-time diagnostics.\n• Build &amp; Run: Compile and execute Kotlin, Java, Python, Go, Rust, C/C++, TypeScript, Node.js, PHP, Ruby, Lua, and Shell scripts with interactive input.\n• Modern Code Editor: Syntax highlighting across 35+ languages, code folding, sticky scroll headers, and customizable color themes.\n• Git &amp; GitHub: Clone public and private repositories, stage changes, inspect diffs, switch branches, and push commits.\n• Linux Terminal: Integrated Ubuntu 24.04 LTS environment with Zsh, shell plugins, and offline backup and restore.</string>
